      "data": {
        "value": "<p><strong><u>Specimen</u> :</strong><strong> </strong>Peripheral blood</p>\n<p><strong><u>Reason for Referral</u> :&nbsp;</strong>? 15q deletion (Prader-Willi Syndrome)</p>\n<p><strong><u>Method</u> : </strong>Flourescent in-situ hybridisation (FISH).</p>\n<p><strong><u>Probe</u> : </strong><em>XL </em>Prader-Willi/Angelman Dual color Probe, Metasystem.</p>\n<p><strong><u>Result Summary</u> :</strong><strong> </strong>Negative</p>\n<p><strong><u>Interpretation</u>: </strong>Specimen is negative for Deletion 15q11.2-q12.</p>\n<p><strong><u>Result:</u></strong><strong> </strong>ish 15q11.2q12(SNRPNx2)(PMLx2)[20]</p>\n<p>20 out of 20 (100%) analysed metaphases showed 2O 2G signals in chromosome 15 region q11.2-q12</p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><u>Result table :</u></span></h1>\n<table class=\"Table cke_show_border\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Chromosome abnormality screened</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Total metaphases analysed</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Result</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Del15 (q11.2-12)</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>20</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Negative</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Cut off for the normal individuals is 3%.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://radiology-flabs.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/aa171dd9745b0a1df403.png\" data-cke-saved-src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Recommendation</u> : </strong>In case of normal FISH result, microarray analysis is further advised to detect smaller deletions or regions not coved by the FISH probe.</p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
